(:taskCollection
  :id "Phase475EngineRuntimeEvaluatorAndModuleFoundation"
  :createdAt 1789375000000
  :status "completed"
  :priorityOrder 1
  :summary "Engine Runtime, Evaluator & Module Foundation: qualified enum constructors bound in evaluator and binary recompiled; non-existent core/strings eradicated across 5 packages; :exports normalized to :x; Clojure ns headers replaced with pure ASL module; pure functional steps-pipeline; and vacuous assertions eliminated."
  :phase "Phase475EngineRuntimeEvaluatorAndModuleFoundation"
  :baseline "Measured 2026-09-12 by monorepo empirical audit recorded in .asl/mem/decisions/GAPS.asn. 36 native test suites fail under asl test --strict-falsify. Core causes: engine.js registers enum variants bare, failing qualified variant calls (tr/RuntimeKind:browser-webpage, InferenceTarget:on-device-webgpu); binary bin/asl embeds compiled engine_js.h and requires recompilation; non-existent module core/strings is imported across 8 test and source files in asl-sql, agent-bus, mem, editorial-matrix, and harness; Clojure (ns ...) headers in asl/web views trigger ERR_UNBOUND_SYMBOL; non-standard :exports in 4 modules masks exported symbols; steps-pipeline uses imperative set! and non-existent to-string; and browser-bridge-test contains 3 consecutive vacuous (assert true) statements."
  :tasks [
    (:task
      :id "Task47501" :parentId "" :phase "phase-475"
      :title "Evaluator Qualified Enum Constructor Binding & Native Binary Recompilation"
      :kind :engine :state :completed :lane "engine" :priority :critical :ownerRole "implementer"
      :createdAt 1789375000000 :updatedAt 1789375000000
      :motivation "engine.js registers enum variants bare in the environment scope, so qualified calls like (InferenceTarget:on-device-webgpu) and (tr/RuntimeKind:browser-webpage) fail with ERR_UNBOUND_SYMBOL. Because bin/asl embeds engine_js.h as a compiled C string literal, any edit to engine.js must be regenerated via gen_engine_header.sh and recompiled into bin/asl to take effect in the native runtime."
      :purpose "Register qualified enum variant constructors (${enumName}:${variantName}) and module-prefixed variant closures in engine.js. Run gen_engine_header.sh and recompile bin/asl. Both browser_agent_test and quota_test must pass cleanly."
      :context (:contractRef D81PlanContext)
      :outcomes ["Qualified enum constructors bound in evaluator" "engine_js.h regenerated" "bin/asl recompiled" "browser_agent_test and quota_test pass"]
      :owns ["asl/tools/engine.js" "asl/tools/engine_js.h" "asl/tools/asl.c" "asl/asl" "bin/asl"]
      :targetSymbols ["register_enum" "js_evaluate_expression"] :relatedSymbols ["tools" "gates"]
      :invariants ["C3" "D81"] :variations (:contractRef D81SettledChoices)
      :failureModes (:contractRef D81TaskFailureModes) :additionalRequirements (:contractRef D81Ownership)
      :adr "D81" :decision "d81" :dependsOn []
      :gate "./bin/asl test browser-plugin/tests/browser_agent_test.asl && ./bin/asl test web-api-search/tests/quota_test.asl"
      :acceptanceCriteria (:contractRef D81BehavioralAcceptance)
      :contractRefs [D81PlanContext D81SettledChoices D81TaskFailureModes D81BehavioralAcceptance D81Baseline D81Ownership D81Receipts]
      :verificationRole "independentVerifier" :verificationOwns ["browser-plugin/tests/browser_agent_test.asl" "web-api-search/tests/quota_test.asl"]
      :verificationCases ["Calling qualified enum constructor resolves cleanly." "Cross-module alias calling qualified enum constructor succeeds." "Recompiled binary evaluates test suites to exit 0."]
      :gateReadiness :requiresIndependentBaseline
      :baselineProbe (:command "./bin/asl test browser-plugin/tests/browser_agent_test.asl" :status :failing :contract D81Baseline)
      :historicalReceipts [] :reviewStatus :requiresIndependentPlanReview
      :actionDag ["Bind qualified variant symbols in engine.js." "Export aliased variants in module import resolver." "Run gen_engine_header.sh." "Recompile bin/asl." "Run gate verification."] :stepIndex 1 :receipts ["rc-phase47501-verified-20260912"])

    (:task
      :id "Task47502" :parentId "" :phase "phase-475"
      :title "Eradicate Non-Existent core/strings Across All Monorepo Packages"
      :kind :remediation :state :completed :lane "boundary" :priority :critical :ownerRole "implementer"
      :createdAt 1789375000000 :updatedAt 1789375000000
      :motivation "Eight test and source modules import (core/strings :a s) which does not exist anywhere in the filesystem. This triggers fatal ERR_UNRESOLVED_IMPORT across asl-sql, agent-bus, mem, editorial-matrix, harness, and asl/web. In addition, browser-bridge-test:68-70 contains three vacuous (assert true) statements violating ground-truth standards."
      :purpose "Re-point all string imports to canonical (asl-text/string :a s) or native string primitives. Declare asl-text in manifests. Replace vacuous assertions in browser-bridge-test with concrete CORS header assertions."
      :context (:contractRef D81PlanContext)
      :outcomes ["Zero imports of core/strings monorepo-wide" "asl-text declared in manifests" "All 8 failing test suites pass compilation" "Vacuous assertions eradicated"]
